        out_append , to_string , column;
        out_append , " (byte ";
        out_append , to_string , offset;
        out_append , ")";
        out;

// A half open range of code points carrying one property value. Every table in
// this file is a vector of one of the range structs below.

// One row of the case mapping table. A delta of zero with a target of minus
// one means "no mapping"; special casing lives in a separate table because a
// single code point can expand to three.

// A code point whose case mapping is longer than one code point.

// One canonical decomposition: source expands to first plus second. A second
// of zero marks a singleton decomposition.

// The result of one grapheme, word or code point step over a buffer.

